R3205 EVIDENCE (2026-11-22) - a BARE proof line now has a machine name.

Board head taken: R3204 next-window (0) MAIN - the opposite direction of R3204.
R3204 taught --check to count CARRIED lines (marked carrier proofs). It counts
only lines that carry the prefix, so a proof line that entered qa/ WITHOUT
do_write read as a clean file: carried=0 and no other field.

Measured read-only first (tmp/probe_R3205.py, private system temp dir, zero
socket, zero network, no live-disk write; every CLI-shaped case real subprocess
or in-process module call):

