Honest limits: zero payment capability and no network beyond loopback - a count
still moves no money and a buyer still cannot pay (no merchant id, server,
domain, filing+ICP, miniprogram appid+secret). Zero product surface, zero api
surface, zero gate number: what changed is whether a bare proof line can be
seen by a machine. bare_proofs=N is not a verdict - it says this file holds N
unmarked lines that prove other files, not that the body is right or wrong. The
stream_evidence birth site was deliberately NOT changed this window; it is
recorded as the next-window option. Only exact shapes are counted.
